Get the process image name.
GetProcessName() / GetProcessNameByPEPROCESS() pull the full image path for a PID or PEPROCESS: [tools.cpp (line 10)](/C:/Users/hallo/Downloads/MasterHide/MasterHide/tools.cpp:10), [tools.cpp (line 47)](/C:/Users/hallo/Downloads/MasterHide/MasterHide/tools.cpp:47)

