The helpers in [mh_hooks.cpp (line 7)](/C:/Users/hallo/Downloads/MasterHide/MasterHide/mh_hooks.cpp:7) use wcsstr / strstr, so this is a simple substring match, not a config file, not regex, and not exact equality.

Apply per-hook behavior depending on the category.

The categories are:
szProtectedDrivers
These driver names are hidden from SystemModuleInformation enumeration: [globals.hpp (line 24)](/C:/Users/hallo/Downloads/MasterHide/MasterHide/globals.hpp:24), [mh_hooks.cpp (line 560)](/C:/Users/hallo/Downloads/MasterHide/MasterHide/mh_hooks.cpp:560)

