These are not hidden; they are just logged when certain memory/process operations touch them: [globals.hpp (line 43)](/C:/Users/hallo/Downloads/MasterHide/MasterHide/globals.hpp:43), [mh_hooks.cpp (line 176)](/C:/Users/hallo/Downloads/MasterHide/MasterHide/mh_hooks.cpp:176)

