### 4. Fix the TestHide `printf` warnings

In `TestHide/main.cpp`, there’s a line:

```cpp
printf("HWND from point 0x%X\n", hWnd);
```

`hWnd` is a pointer, but `%X` expects an `unsigned int`. Change it to:

```cpp
printf("HWND from point %p\n", hWnd);
```

(Or cast to `(unsigned int)(UINT_PTR)hWnd` if you really want hex, but `%p` is cleaner.)

